====================================================================================================
H -- K_T and G_T FROM THE CONSTRAINT-REDUCED ACTION
====================================================================================================
  [ok ] H0  no + / x mixing survives the reduction
  [ok ] H1  K_T = 1 EXACTLY -- both polarisations, all theta, constraints solved
         reason (DERIVED): time derivatives appear ONLY in K_ij; (3)R, a_i a^i, X and Y_a are purely spatial; and Kbar_ij = 0 removes every phi-gammadot cross term.  Neither lam_K nor eta_K nor eps enters K_T.  Independently reproduced to 5e-11 by the exact-nonlinear numerical route in gen2_tensor_numeric_crosscheck_2026.py.

  G_T (+), eikonal leading order: (X_0**(15/2) + 2*X_0**(13/2)*epsilon + 7*X_0**(13/2) + 6*X_0**(11/2)*epsilon + 18*X_0**(11/2) + 22*X_0**(9/2) + 13*X_0**(7/2) + 3*X_0**(5/2) + 3*X_0**7 + 6*X_0**6*epsilon + 13*X_0**6 + 2*X_0**5*epsilon + 22*X_0**5 + 18*X_0**4 + 7*X_0**3 + X_0**2)/(X_0**(15/2) + 7*X_0**(13/2) + 18*X_0**(11/2) + 22*X_0**(9/2) + 13*X_0**(7/2) + 3*X_0**(5/2) + 3*X_0**7 + 13*X_0**6 + 22*X_0**5 + 18*X_0**4 + 7*X_0**3 + X_0**2)
